<html style="overflow-y: hidden;">
<head>
    <title>New Appointment</title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</p>

<p>Your appointment has been scheduled. Here are the details:</p>

<table cellpadding="8" style="border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="background:#F5F9FC; border:1px solid #E0E0E0; font-weight:bold;">Date &amp; Time</td>
    <td style="border:1px solid #E0E0E0;">{{{Appointment__c.Appointment_Datetime__c}}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background:#F5F9FC; border:1px solid #E0E0E0; font-weight:bold;">Doctor</td>
    <td style="border:1px solid #E0E0E0;">{{{Appointment__c.Doctor__r.Name}}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background:#F5F9FC; border:1px solid #E0E0E0; font-weight:bold;">Type</td>
    <td style="border:1px solid #E0E0E0;">{{{Appointment__c.Appointment_Type__c}}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background:#F5F9FC; border:1px solid #E0E0E0; font-weight:bold;">Status</td>
    <td style="border:1px solid #E0E0E0;">{{{Appointment__c.Status__c}}}</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>Please arrive 15 minutes early. If you need to reschedule, contact your village health worker.</p>

<p>Kizuna Care<br/>
Healthcare for rural India</p>
</body>
</html>
